      "text": "Maybe try mouse bait, obviously tucked into places mice can get to and others can't. I don't like using it but sometimes there's no other option. This place we live in was overrun with mice. The first few years the cats would bring them upstairs to let loose so they could play with them! At least twice a week! Saved a few and relocated them. Sealed up what we could, but the garage was off limits to the cats. When they disabled the door openers, it was bait time. On a third bag, but seems the last of them are gone. 2 partial baits still sitting there. Now it will be time to get an electrician to fix the openers and/or wiring. 😢\n\nSo long as the bait is tucked into areas only mice can access, it should at least reduce the numbers.",
